       "html": "<p>This year be sure to send holiday wishes with adorable cards from a very creative artist in Ireland.&nbsp; They are the perfect way to wish your loved ones a Merry Christmas and Happy New Year.</p>\n<p>Susan McGing studied in the creative stream of the DIT Postgrad Diploma in Advertising.&nbsp; She has worked as a content creator and copywriter for clients such as EPIC, Fáilte Ireland, Tourism Ireland, and Trinity College.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Susan's biggest passion lies with storytelling, as she thrives from brainstorming with a team and telling a story through exciting work.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>She currently works as a freelance illustrator, running her own illustration shop (Susan Illustrates) where she sells cards, commissions, and prints of her own designs.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>You can check out her <a href=\"https://www.etsy.com/shop/susanillustrates/\">Etsy Shop</a> where you can purchase her cards.&nbsp; They will definitely be a nice touch of Irish flare this Holiday Season.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em>Written by Taryn Harrison</em></p>"
      }
     ],
